dentifying outdated/soon-to-be-unsupported technologies requiring curriculum updates.", "acceptanceCriteria": ["Script `scripts/audit_equipment_eol.py` parses equipment lists from all 20 CoCu files, queries vendor EOL APIs (Dell, Cisco, Microsoft, Linux distros)", "Output CSV at `output/equipment_audit.csv` with columns: item_name, coCu_file, release_year, eol_date, status (Current/Aging/EOL), suggested_replacement", "CLI report: flag any items EOL before 2027 as requiring immediate curriculum review"], "estimatedComplexity": "small", "_source": "ai-product-owner"}, {"title": "Bloom's 2023 Taxonomy Auto-Classifier with Cognitive Level Distribution Reporting", "priority": "high", "description": "Automatically classify all learning outcomes in bilingual CoCu files using Bloom's 2023 revised taxonomy (Remember, Understand, Apply, Analyze, Evaluate, Create). Enforce minimum 20% Create-level outcomes per CoCu. Generate distribution charts and suggest outcome rewrites for deeper cognitive levels.", "acceptanceCriteria": ["Function `scripts/classify_blooms_levels.py` uses transformer-based NLP (distilroberta fine-tuned on Bloom's corpora) to classify outcomes with >0.8 confidence", "Output JSON at `output/blooms_classification.json` with structure: {coCu_file, outcomes: [{text, english_level, malay_level, confidence}]}", "Generate HTML dashboard at `output/blooms_distribution.html` with bar charts showing level distribution and flag CoCu files below 20% Create-level as failing validation"], "estimatedComplexity": "medium", "_source": "ai-product-owner"}, {"title": "Misconception Remediation Database and Interactive Flowchart Generator", "priority": "medium", "description": "Build database of common student misconceptions per CoCu topic (sourced from education research + instructor feedback). Generate decision-tree flowcharts for remediation strategies. Integrate into instructor facilitation guides with evidence-based corrective actions.", "acceptanceCriteria": ["JSON schema at `scripts/misconceptions.json` with structure: {topic, coCu_file, misconceptions: [{error, correct_concept, remediation_strategy}]}", "Generate Mermaid flowchart diagrams at `output/misconception_flowcharts/{coCu_name}.md` showing decision paths from common errors to corrective actions", "CLI: `uv run scripts/generate_misconception_guides.py` produces instructor guide PDFs at `output/instructor_guides/` with embedded flowcharts and evidence sources"], "estimatedComplexity": "medium", "_source": "ai-product-owner"}, {"title": "Automated Lab Procedure Screenshot Capture with Annotation and Timestamping", "priority": "medium", "description": "Automate screenshot capture of lab procedures (VM/hardware setups) with step-by-step annotations. Generate visual worksheets from screenshot sequences, annotating with step numbers, expected results, and timing estimates. Reduce manual lab worksheet creation time.", "acceptanceCriteria": ["Script `scripts/capture_lab_screenshots.py` integrates with VM control (Hyper-V/VirtualBox) or hardware via serial console to capture screenshots at each step", "Output visual worksheets at `output/lab_worksheets/{coCu_name}_lab_{number}.pdf` with: screenshot + annotation overlay (step #, expected result, timing)", "Config file at `scripts/lab_procedures.yaml` defines capture sequences per CoCu lab (e.g., 'Server Install': [power_on, bios_menu, os_selection, ...])"], "estimatedComplexity": "medium", "_source": "ai-product-owner"}, {"title": "Bilingual Glossary Consistency Validator: Terminology Harmonization Across All CoCu Files", "priority": "medium", "description": "Detect terminology variants and inconsistent translations across all 20 English/Bahasa Malaysia CoCu files. Flag when same English term is translated differently or vice versa. Generate unified glossary export and suggest standardized terminology for JPK submission consistency.", "acceptanceCriteria": ["Function `scripts/validate_glossary_consistency.py` extracts all key terms